/ locals: current_server, viewing_self
.card.border-secondary
  .card-body.text-center.py-5
    i.bi.bi-person-x.text-muted.fs-1.d-block.mb-3
    - if viewing_self
      h5.text-light.mb-2 No player on #{current_server.server_name}
      p.text-muted.mb-0 You haven't spawned in on this server yet. Hop in-game to spawn, then check back here.
    - else
      / Not a failed lookup. The UID resolved fine, it simply has no character on this server, which is an answer in
      / its own right when the question is "have they ever played here".
      h5.text-light.mb-2 Never connected to #{current_server.server_name}
      p.text-muted.mb-0 This Steam UID has no character here, so there's nothing on the server to show.
